<title>USA: Moody's raises Tulsa College, Okla., to A2.</title>
<headline>Moody's raises Tulsa College, Okla., to A2.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Oct 4 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating Announcement As of 10/04/96. Issuer		: Tulsa Comm. College Student center rev.</p>
<p>			  (Formerly Jr.)</p>
<p>State		 : OK</p>
<p>Rating		: A2</p>
